  unitName: Sky Boss Grafl
  unitId: 40062
  unitNumber: 86
  description: An air pirate using an other-worldly pistol, widely known in the ruined
    Atharva Republic. He traveled with his crew on his airship, and once fought against
    the republic soldier, Falma. Impressed, Grafl asked him to join, but Falma refused,
    wanting an equal partnership. Still, they became close friends, standing shoulder-to-shoulder
    through many battles.
  summonDesc: Were you looking for me<br>or for my pistol?<br>Matters not, for we're
    a team!
  fusionDesc: Reloading complete!<br>I'm ready to fight!
  evoDesc: Do you have the courage and<br>resolution to stand in front <br>of my
    pistol?
